<title>USA: DeKalb sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>DeKalb sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>DEKALB, Ill. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>DeKalb Genetics Corp said Friday its board had approved a two-for-one stock split, payable August 8, record July 25.</p>
<p>Following the split, DeKalb will have 4.8 million Class A shares and 29.6 million Class B shares outstanding, it said.</p>
<p>The company's annual dividend will be adjusted to $0.14 per share from $0.28.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
